ittee.html\"},{\"title\":\"Committee on Energy and Commerce (119th Congress) | Democrats, Energy and Commerce Committee\",\"url\":\"https://democrats-energycommerce.house.gov/subcommittees/committee-energy-and-commerce-119th-congress\"},{\"title\":\"rules of the committee on energy and commerce, u.s. ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.congress.gov/committee-print/119th-congress/house-committee-print/58504\"},{\"title\":\"Subcommittees\",\"url\":\"https://energycommerce.house.gov/subcommittees\"},{\"title\":\"committee energy and commerce 119th congress\",\"url\":\"https://democrats-energycommerce.house.gov/subcommittees/committee-energy-and-commerce-119th-congress?page=8\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here is information about the House Energy and Commerce Subcommittee on Health jurisdiction for the 119th Congress:\n\n## Jurisdiction\n\nThe Subcommittee on Health has jurisdiction over: Public health and quarantine, including emergency preparedness and response; hospital construction; mental health; health disparities; biomedical research and development; health information technology (Office of the National Coordinator for Health Information Technology), privacy and cybersecurity; public health insurance (Medicare, Medicaid, the Children's Health Insurance Program) and private health insurance; medical malpractice and medical malpractice insurance; the regulation of human and animal drugs, vaccines and other biological products, devices, food, cosmetics, and tobacco (the Food and Drug Administration); substance use and misuse, including the Control Substances Act and the Office of National Drug Control Policy; and the Department of Health and Human Services, including the National Institutes of Health and the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention and the Indian Health Service.\n\n## Committee Structure\n\nDuring the 119th Congress, which convened in January 2025, the Energy and Commerce Committee had fifty-four members (thirty Republicans and twenty-four Democrats) and six subcommittees: Communications and Technology, Energy, Environment, Health and Commerce, Manufacturing, and Trade.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6e0396ec-d887-404f-a03a-dd21daaf8ac5","uuid":"63112ad2-f7f2-4829-bd68-52c259a8890a","timestamp":"2026-09-01T15:52:25.858Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"House Energy and Commerce Subcommittee on Health jurisdiction rules 119th Congress","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01MHYSMqChGpQouZ9NNeo1tM","content":[{"title":"Subcommittees - House Committee on Energy and Commerce","url":"https://energycommerce.house.gov/committees"},{"title":"House Committee on Energy and Commerce","url":"https://energycommerce.house.gov/"},{"title":"United States House Committee on Energy and Commerce | Power and Energy | Research Starters | EBSCO Research","url":"https://www.ebsco.com/research-starters/power-and-energy/united-states-house-committee-energy-and-commerce"},{"title":"Health (119th Congress) | Democrats, Energy and Commerce Committee","url":"https://democrats-energycommerce.house.gov/subcommittees/health"},{"title":"Energy and Commerce Jursidiction","url":"https://energycommerce.house.gov/energy-and-commerce-jursidiction"},{"title":"House Energy and Commerce Committee Health Subcommittee - Summary from LegiStorm","url":"https://www.legistorm.com/organization/summary/97703/House_Energy_and_Commerce_Committee_Health_Subcommittee.html"},{"title":"Committee on Energy and Commerce (119th Congress) | Democrats, Energy and Commerce Committee","url":"https://democrats-energycommerce.house.gov/subcommittees/committee-energy-and-commerce-119th-congress"},{"title":"rules of the committee on energy and commerce, u.s. ...","url":"https://www.congress.gov/committee-print/119th-congress/house-committee-print/58504"},{"title":"Subcommittees","url":"https://energycommerce.house.gov/subcommittees"},{"title":"committee energy a